# Google Calendar

Call the Google Calendar API as the connected user through the Google
Calendar MCP server connected to this session. The session's MCP relay
attaches the user's credential on every call; never ask for or handle
credentials yourself.

{{ACTION_AVAILABILITY_SECTION}}

## Usage

Read tools (calendars, events, free/busy) run freely; creating and deleting
events are the only writes. `primary` is the user's default calendar. Read
tools that paginate should be capped with a result limit to keep your context
small.

